Template: bitcoin/taproot
Type: boolean
Description: Do you accept the Taproot protocol change for Bitcoin?
 CAUTION: BITCOIN PROTOCOL CHANGE INCLUDED
 .
 This and all future versions enforce the Taproot protocol change to the Bitcoin rules, which activated in 2021 November without opposition.
 Protocol changes require user consent to be effective, and if enforced inconsistently within the community may compromise your security or others!
 Since the community has activated Taproot, you must also enforce it to remain secure.
 You must answer "yes" to upgrade to this version.
